    "body": "## When dragging with the mouse\r\n- Allow negative `mouse_row` and `mouse_col` values. These should cause the window to scroll up or scroll to the left respectively.\r\n- Unset `MOUSE_DID_MOVE` `jump_to_mouse ` flag . Repeated mouse drag events beyond the window should continue to scroll the window even when the mouse has not moved.\r\n- Scroll the window leftward when no `nowrap` is set and `mouse_col` is less than `0`.\r\n- Remove unnecessary scrolling logic in `do_mouse` function.",
    "closed_at": "2026-08-04T02:17:13Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
