            "body": "Perhaps this should first be submitted as a patch to vim? I think most of these functions are still largely the same in vim.\r\n\r\n(At least that's what I remember from when I started work on a patch that enabled right click on statusline/column/winbar elements with `mousemodel != setpos`.)",
